Several:

* Killing with the first zap of a beam (not ray) wand/spell (whether
  directly in the case of drain life or striking, or indirectly via
  system shock).
* Crushing in or causing to fall off a drawbridge.
* Polyselfed passive attacks triggered by being conflicted against you.
* Hitting with a potion that does damage (acid, holy water, etc).
* Clobbering with a scroll of earth.
* Failed-untrapping from a bear trap.

